<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 315 ALL OUT V KENT.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 315 ALL OUT V KENT.</headline>
<dateline>CANTERBURY, England 1997-08-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were all out for 315 at lunch on the second day of a three-day match against Kent on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Kent 201, Australia 315 (S.Waugh 154, M.Bevan 55).</p>
</text>
